# Test fixtures intentionally tracked despite the figures/ and *.log ignores above.
# The latex_audit suite needs a present figure (existence check) and a synthetic
# compile log (log-scan checks); both would otherwise be swallowed by line 18 and 26.
!tests/fixtures/latex_audit/figures/
!tests/fixtures/latex_audit/figures/present.pdf
!tests/fixtures/latex_audit/main.log
